  "description": "What does it take for an animal to live and survive? What would it choose to die for? A T. rex, washed ashore and stranded on an island for over 20 years, waits for the day he can take his final breath. But just when that moment seems near, hope arrives. \n\nA collection of stories about the great creatures that have roamed the Earth before us.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\n1-19. **Gaji Aneun Gil** (가지 않은 길, The Road Not Taken)\n20-28. **Pokgun** (폭군, The Tyrant)\n29-40. **Manghyang** (폭군, Nostalgia)",
